{"id":"67cfda1c3884c68c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyTermInst.md","title":"PolyTermInst","display":"PolyTermInst","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyTermInst","parameters":["c","h","s","t","u"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyTermInst"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>c</span><span>h</span><span>s</span><span>t</span><span>u</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 双绑定替换与规约。有序参数：<code>c</code>、<code>h</code>、<code>s</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>。</p>\n<p>项 β 的绑定删除：经过 h 个类型绑定时，插入项先作类型提升 h，再作项提升 c。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyTermInst c h s t u)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z2098 (@ PolyTermInstProof c h s t u z2098))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"10786116fd4ee461\" href=\"?note=10786116fd4ee461\" title=\"ZFC_PolyTermInstProof\">PolyTermInstProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyTermInst c h s t u)` 按 [[00